contentText:
Miranda Lambert is celebrating her husband Brendan McLoughlin&#8217;s birthday by putting a new spin on the longest-leading Billboard Hot 100 hit of all time. And who better to craft new lyrics for Ella Langley&#8217;s &#8220;Choosin&#8217; Texas&#8221; than the woman who co-wrote them in the first place?

